# Written with the help of Claude Code

# Released packages every installation of the ROS2 PAR Framework needs. Those are installed instead of
# cloned from a repository. See required_repos.list for the nodes that do not have a release, e.g. custom
# framework nodes and apps.

# One rosdep key per line: usually the ROS package name, e.g. realsense2_camera for
# ros-<distro>-realsense2-camera. rosdep picks the right apt package for the sourced distro.
# Find a key with: rosdep resolve <key>

# Every package listed here is installed by scripts/local_build.sh, like the repositories in required_repos.list.
# Nothing is needed here yet.

# Camera drivers are chosen per installation: the gitignored config/installed_ros_packages.list (same format,
# written by the setup wizard, read by local_build.sh next to this file) holds the chosen ones. The camera
# types in packages/par_camera_adapters/resource/par_framework_cameras/ name their drivers under
# required_packages:
#   v4l2_camera               generic UVC webcam (camera type webcam)
#   realsense2_camera         RealSense depth camera (camera type realsense)
#   spinnaker_camera_driver   FLIR Blackfly S and other Spinnaker cameras, with the SDK (camera type blackfly)
#   metavision_driver         event cameras on OpenEB, e.g. SilkyEvCam (camera type event); some need a
#   event_camera_renderer     vendor plugin, see par_setup.yaml. The renderer turns events into images.
